### List org insights
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/org-insights?status=Active
Content-Type: application/json

### Upsert org insight
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/org-insights
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
{
  "account_id": 1,
  "rating": "Strong",
  "status": "Active",
  "tags": ["STEM", "After-School"],
  "notes": "Key partner; overlap with ALN-84.215"
}

### List people ratings
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/people-ratings
Content-Type: application/json

### Upsert people rating
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/people-ratings
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
{
  "contact_id": 1,
  "score": 80,
  "affinity": "Champion",
  "influence_level": "High",
  "notes": "Met with program officer"
}

### Funding sources
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/funding/sources
Content-Type: application/json

POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/funding/sources
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
{
  "name": "US Dept of Labor",
  "category": "Federal",
  "region": "US",
  "website": "https://www.dol.gov"
}

### Grants catalog
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/grants/catalog
Content-Type: application/json

POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/grants/catalog
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
{
  "funding_source_id": 1,
  "code": "DOL-ETA-25",
  "title": "WIOA Youth",
  "focus_areas": ["Workforce", "Youth"],
  "deadline_at": "2025-12-01"
}

### Map org to grant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/org-grants
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
{
  "account_id": 1,
  "grant_id": 1,
  "stage": "Applied",
  "amount_requested": 40000
}

### Overlaps view
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/grants/overlaps
Content-Type: application/json

### Watchlist
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/intel/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
{
  "entity_type": "Org",
  "entity_id": 1,
  "reason": "Competes on same DOE grant",
  "priority": "Medium"
}